2.	Project Overview & Scope
    •	Project Title: Behind the Wheel or Under the Hood: What Wins the Race?
    • Big Question: What makes a NASCAR driver fast?
            - Analyzing this through three main areas:
                1.) on track pace: overall race pace and how well drivers maintain pace over time (tire wear, etc)
                2.) passing and track position: how effectively drivers gain and maintain position
                3.) pit-road performance: how much track position drivers gain or lose during pit cycles
