3.	Investigative Questions
The three main areas can be split into six questions:
    AREA 1: On-track pace
    1. Question 1: Which drivers have the fastest average green-flag race pace over the season?
    2. Question 2: Which drivers best maintain their pace over long green-flag runs as their tires wear?
    AREA 2: Passing and track position
    3. Question 3: Which drivers gain the most positions under green-flag racing?
    4. Question 4: Which drivers are most effective at maintaining strong running positions throughout a race?
    AREA 3: Pit road performance
    5. Question 5: Which drivers/teams gain or lose the most positions during pit cycles?
    6. Question 6: How does pit road performance relate to finishing position?

